0018:b004:l016","ordinal":186546,"en":"Your father's gift,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l017","ordinal":186547,"en":"From Almambet and Chubak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l018","ordinal":186548,"en":"Is there any offspring?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l019","ordinal":186549,"en":"Come around my servant,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l020","ordinal":186550,"en":"Today you saw the city of Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l021","ordinal":186551,"en":"My sister is from Manas"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l022","ordinal":186552,"en":"alone,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l023","ordinal":186553,"en":"Today I'm going home for the night,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l024","ordinal":186554,"en":"You will show the guest,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l025","ordinal":186555,"en":"You wanted to tell a story."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l026","ordinal":186556,"en":"Hey Semetei, my servant,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l027","ordinal":186557,"en":"You stopped your air in Kapka-Tasha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l028","ordinal":186558,"en":"You made me cry!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l029","ordinal":186559,"en":"If I want to sleep,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l030","ordinal":186560,"en":"I wish the same."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l031","ordinal":186561,"en":"When Manas comes to mind"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l032","ordinal":186562,"en":"My heart burns."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l033","ordinal":186563,"en":"Moaning gorge,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l034","ordinal":186564,"en":"I dream a lot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l035","ordinal":186565,"en":"Konurbai of Aleoku"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l036","ordinal":186566,"en":"When you turn sixty, brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l037","ordinal":186567,"en":"Kyzytalak Kakanda"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l038","ordinal":186568,"en":"Who better than"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0018:b004:l039","ordinal":186569,"en":"The best dress of all,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l001","ordinal":186570,"en":"His heroism was of another order."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l002","ordinal":186571,"en":"In Beijing of the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l003","ordinal":186572,"en":"This is the building he erected;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l004","ordinal":186573,"en":"If you ask about that destroyer,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l005","ordinal":186574,"en":"This is the mighty khan of the monks."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l006","ordinal":186575,"en":"He was more skillful than a spearman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l007","ordinal":186576,"en":"A mighty one who could subjugate"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l008","ordinal":186577,"en":"The whole world."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l009","ordinal":186578,"en":"Born in this Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l010","ordinal":186579,"en":"He fought without rest in the Altai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l011","ordinal":186580,"en":"Against your father, hero Manas;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l012","ordinal":186581,"en":"That dog raised the turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l013","ordinal":186582,"en":"Beijing there is a vast, gated city;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l014","ordinal":186583,"en":"It has a thousand learned men."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l015","ordinal":186584,"en":"If I speak of hero Kongurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l016","ordinal":186585,"en":"His tales will never end."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l017","ordinal":186586,"en":"His tiger bore fifteen cubs;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l018","ordinal":186587,"en":"No mortal has gone near him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l019","ordinal":186588,"en":"Speaking of Beijing, there is disaster:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l020","ordinal":186589,"en":"Skilled on horseback and swift on foot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l021","ordinal":186590,"en":"It has champions to face mortals."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l022","ordinal":186591,"en":"This year, my son Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l023","ordinal":186592,"en":"Understand your uncle's words;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l024","ordinal":186593,"en":"My lion, my son, heed me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l025","ordinal":186594,"en":"This year, without turning aside,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l026","ordinal":186595,"en":"To Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l027","ordinal":186596,"en":"Let us bring a mighty spectacle, my son."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l028","ordinal":186597,"en":"Let us raid every horse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l029","ordinal":186598,"en":"Of that Kalcha slave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l030","ordinal":186599,"en":"Then grow fat and refreshed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l031","ordinal":186600,"en":"Yesterday, truly, those few people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l032","ordinal":186601,"en":"Who let themselves be taken to Kakan-Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l033","ordinal":186602,"en":"Must have had weak horses."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l034","ordinal":186603,"en":"Let us prepare swift horses;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l035","ordinal":186604,"en":"Their clothing must have worn out,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l036","ordinal":186605,"en":"So let us prepare strong clothing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l037","ordinal":186606,"en":"These numerous Chinese people—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l038","ordinal":186607,"en":"Their multitude is like black worms."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b003:l039","ordinal":186608,"en":"Let us consult Chyiyrdy and Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l001","ordinal":186609,"en":"Take counsel with Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l002","ordinal":186610,"en":"And prepare ample provisions well."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l003","ordinal":186611,"en":"Let us deliberate together;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l004","ordinal":186612,"en":"Then afterward, in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l005","ordinal":186613,"en":"Let us create a great tale."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l006","ordinal":186614,"en":"My son, Beijing is no playground;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l007","ordinal":186615,"en":"Gated Beijing with its royal court"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l008","ordinal":186616,"en":"Is no place for games."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l009","ordinal":186617,"en":"It has a desert forty days across,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l010","ordinal":186618,"en":"An accursed land such as this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l011","ordinal":186619,"en":"My son, whoever has inhabited Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l012","ordinal":186620,"en":"Those who attacked Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l013","ordinal":186621,"en":"Never turned back to see their homes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l014","ordinal":186622,"en":"Beijing's forty-day expanse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l015","ordinal":186623,"en":"Has a broad river road."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0019:b005:l016","ordinal":186624,"en":"Misery awaits whoever encounters it."}]
